{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd86 A stupidly fun hide-and-seek  game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere in every level\u2026 there\u2019s a duck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll hear it quack every few minutes, but finding it? That\u2019s up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore bizarre maps, uncover weird secrets, and maybe \u2014 just maybe \u2014 survive whatever else is out there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What starts as a silly game of \u201cWhere\u2019s the duck?\u201d quickly becomes something\u2026 stranger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd0d Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5+ handcrafted levels that get bigger, weirder, and more difficult</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rubber duck that quacks every few minutes to give you a hint \u2014 or lure you in</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden scares and disturbing surprises across the maps (don\u2019t say we didn\u2019t warn you)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of comedy and horror \u2014 just enough to make you laugh and look over your shoulder</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat, no time limits \u2014 just you, your wits, and a duck that refuses to sit still</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3805160?t=1753292131","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3805160?t=1753292131","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805160/c465218a7f0cfa259bacc424952742268f1b64e4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753292131","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805160/c465218a7f0cfa259bacc424952742268f1b64e4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753292131","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd86 A stupidly fun hide-and-seek  game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere in every level\u2026 there\u2019s a duck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll hear it quack every few minutes, but finding it? That\u2019s up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore bizarre maps, uncover weird secrets, and maybe \u2014 just maybe \u2014 survive whatever else is out there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What starts as a silly game of \u201cWhere\u2019s the duck?\u201d quickly becomes something\u2026 stranger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd0d Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5+ handcrafted levels that get bigger, weirder, and more difficult</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rubber duck that quacks every few minutes to give you a hint \u2014 or lure you in</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden scares and disturbing surprises across the maps (don\u2019t say we didn\u2019t warn you)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of comedy and horror \u2014 just enough to make you laugh and look over your shoulder</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat, no time limits \u2014 just you, your wits, and a duck that refuses to sit still</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Humza Shakoor","Vejay Fongchoy","TheGoodMen GamingStudio LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805160/7591